From eee17b334382325d68140b14b7ff330316c72d99 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yasen <yasen@trahnov.eu>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 11:27:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add RPM search endpoints nested under Content View

Implements the six search/rpm/* endpoints (packages, package-groups,
environments, errata, module-streams, packages/list) on top of
pulpcore's new ContentView resource, using its scatter_gather utility
for cross-domain resolution. Includes functional tests covering all
six endpoints across two domains and RBAC exclusion.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
